===Usage notes===
Like {{m|en|nationism}}, {{m|en||nationist}} is a technical term used in sociolinguistics, and is ''contrasted'' with {{m|en|nationalist}}. However, {{m|en||nationist}} may also occur as a misspelling of the far more common {{m|en|nationalist|nation<u>al</u>ist}}.

